+	  A thermal sensor whose temperature is a weighted sum of IIO
+	  temperature channels plus an offset, as phones use to estimate
+	  skin temperature from board thermistors (e.g. the LG V30's
+	  "vts"). Weights and offset come from the device tree.
+
 config GENERIC_ADC_THERMAL
 	tristate "Generic ADC based thermal sensor"
 	depends on IIO
